{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:59 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:59 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:59 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac7cdcdc04c15fc4188e46b80e59233a/2026-11/2026-11-27_23_53_38.png\"/><p>乾燥的東北季候風正為華南帶來晴朗的天氣。今早本港多處地區的相對濕度下降至百分之四十左右。</p><p>本港地區今日天晴及非常乾燥，市區最高氣溫約27度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩北至東北風，初時離岸風勢清勁，高地達強風程度。</p><img alt=\"市區最高氣溫約27度，新界再高一兩度。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c514dd1841a051f7e7df930c975d52fb/2026-11/41.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f7a7989ffe0efeaa58c8234a5ec9b46/2026-11/2026-11-27_23_51_56.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e2b8b5560319c3583efe58e135fb96b/2026-11/2026-11-27_23_52_04.png\"/><img alt=\"市區最高氣溫約27度，新界再高一兩度。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00b06fc724c2554044fb30027522bffb/2026-11/42.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"市區最高氣溫約27度，新界再高一兩度。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0bbe84d1c3a307269d83f796fe9a57ba/2026-11/43_0.jpeg\"/><p>展望未來兩三日大致天晴。明日風勢頗大。下週中後期日間相當溫暖。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:23:49.661065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:59:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:27.590765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T00:17:23.919586+00:00","content_hash":"e070458ed4eb9364467c5279d74c1e0e3b1a70017eac35da047b8846c76df2f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}